==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Dragon Cat]] can deal with Teacher Bear easily, while the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]]' low strength magnification means they shouldn't pose too much of a threat.

==Trivia==
*Shokudoraku Domain is named after the Japanese word 食道楽 ''shokudōraku'' (gourmand).

